progress --progressable--> activity
progress: grades = {task id: {F: points}, overall: 0..100}
  metadata = {task id: {F: count, ...}}, progress = 0..100
progress --actor--> users | people
users | people --(v1/people/{id}/emails)--> emails
progress --latest-grade--> lti/grade: grade = overall / 100
\end{verbatim}
