\section{Examples for the contract test}

The contract test (\cref{Schema}) needs an example of every type declared
above.
Progresses and email addresses the launched activity has.
The task types and the grades sent may need a search: not every activity
has a reflection or a peer review, and a grade exists only where FBF has
published one, which it had not for the launched activity when we wrote
this.
So the fetchers look at the launched activity first and then at the other
activities of its course, as those of \cref{Discussions} do.
The multimedia task and the activity have fetchers there already.

<<example fetchers>>=
from fbf import progress as progress_module


def progress_activities(fbf, launched):
    """Yield the launched activity's id, then the others in its course."""
    yield launched.activity_uuid
    for activity in fbf.get(
            f"v1/courses/{launched.course_uuid}/activities").resources:
        if activity["id"] != launched.activity_uuid:
            yield activity["id"]


def progress_example(fbf, launched, kind, resources_of):
    """Return the first resource of `kind` among `resources_of` an
    activity."""
    for activity in progress_activities(fbf, launched):
        for resource in resources_of(fbf, activity):
            if resource["type"] == kind:
                return resource
    raise LookupError(f"no {kind} in the launched course")


